### Get all categories

GET http://localhost:5000/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json

### Get category with id

GET http://localhost:5000/api/categories/2
Content-Type: application/json

### Create category

POST http://localhost:5000/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "t2",
  "description": "test1 description",
  "parent_id": 3
}

### UPDATE category

PUT http://localhost:5000/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 2,
  "name": "Smartphones2",
  "description": "Mobile phones and accessories AND some other stuff",
  "parent_id": 1
}

### Delete category with id

DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/categories/12
Content-Type: application/json
